# The Cloning of Shredder with two cards exiled with it (CR 607.2a). Chapter I on turn 3 exiles Rat King, Verminister (Entombed on
# turn 1) and makes a token copy of it; Garnet then attacks (a 3/3 from the +1/+1 counter) and takes the Saga's lore counter off
# (CR 714.2b). Bot2 Lightning Bolts Garnet on turn 4, so when the Saga gets a lore counter again on turn 5 chapter I triggers a second
# time and exiles Garnet, the only creature card left in the graveyard, with a token copy of her. Chapters II (turn 7) and III (turn
# 9) each copy a card exiled with the Saga, chosen as they resolve (CR 608.2d) from the two: Bot1 picks Garnet for II and Rat King for
# III, so the copy is not always the first card exiled.

